  message: "Fixed in PR #2309 (merged to dev, eaa18ee23). Live repro on dev eaa18ee23, outputs in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr6/live_repro/ havob_hook.log: on a throwaway branch, inserting a line atop symbol_introspection.py and staging it -> pre-commit 'Line citations... ✗', names the off citation [signature_axis.py:195], prints 'Fix: ./scripts/repin-line-citations' and the git add for the registry; hook exit 1. Clean dev: repin-line-citations --check exit 0. Runs only when a staged file is in repin-line-citations --list-paths."  # fbeb
